  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change | References |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| shelljs | devDependencies | patch | `0.8.1` -> `0.8.2` | [source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/shelljs/shelljs) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>shelljs/shelljs</summary>\n\n### [`v0.8.2`](https://renovatebot.com/gh/shelljs/shelljs/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#v082httpsgithubcomshelljsshelljstreev082-2018-05-08)\n\n[Compare Source](https://renovatebot.com/gh/shelljs/shelljs/compare/v0.8.1...v0.8.2)\n\n[Full Changelog](https://renovatebot.com/gh/shelljs/shelljs/compare/v0.8.1...v0.8.2)\n\n**Closed issues:**\n\n-   High severity vulnerability in shelljs 0.8.1 [#&#8203;842](https://renovatebot.com/gh/shelljs/shelljs/issues/842)\n-   Add test for ls() on a symlink to a directory [#&#8203;795](https://renovatebot.com/gh/shelljs/shelljs/issues/795)\n-   Harden shell.exec by writing the child process in a source file [#&#8203;782](https://renovatebot.com/gh/shelljs/shelljs/issues/782)\n-   shell.exec() doesn't respond correctly to config.fatal = true [#&#8203;735](https://renovatebot.com/gh/shelljs/shelljs/issues/735)\n-   Merge 'exec: internal error' with ShellJSInternalError [#&#8203;734](https://renovatebot.com/gh/shelljs/shelljs/issues/734)\n-   exec returning null from command [#&#8203;724](https://renovatebot.com/gh/shelljs/shelljs/issues/724)\n-   Only Get Stderr from Exec [#&#8203;371](https://renovatebot.com/gh/shelljs/shelljs/issues/371)\n-   Execute child.stdout.on before child.on(\"exit\")  [#&#8203;224](https://renovatebot.com/gh/shelljs/shelljs/issues/224)\n\n**Merged pull requests:**\n\n-   Workaround codecov bug of miscalculation of coverage (#&#8203;795) [#&#8203;838](https://renovatebot.com/gh/shelljs/shelljs/pull/838) ([dwi2](https://renovatebot.com/gh/dwi2))\n-   Update doc comments and regenerate README.md. [#&#8203;825](https://renovatebot.com/gh/shelljs/shelljs/pull/825) ([Zearin](https://renovatebot.com/gh/Zearin))\n-   chore: update contributing guidelines [#&#8203;817](https://renovatebot.com/gh/shelljs/shelljs/pull/817) ([nfischer](https://renovatebot.com/gh/nfischer))\n-   chore(lint): don't allow excess trailing newlines [#&#8203;816](https://renovatebot.com/gh/shelljs/shelljs/pull/816) ([nfischer](https://renovatebot.com/gh/nfischer))\n-   Remove separate \"internal error\" from exec [#&#8203;802](https://renovatebot.com/gh/shelljs/shelljs/pull/802) ([freitagbr](https://renovatebot.com/gh/freitagbr))\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: PR created on schedule \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is stale, or if you modify the PR title to begin with \"`rebase!`\".\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://renovatebot.com/gh/marketplace/renovate). View repository job log [here](https://renovatebot.com/dashboard#algolia/instantsearch.js).",
